<title>FRANCE: Highlights of ONIC soft wheat estimates.</title>
<headline>Highlights of ONIC soft wheat estimates.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cereals office ONIC's monthly soft wheat estimates (July/June, million tonnes). * Revisions for 95/96.</p>
<p>			96/97(Nov)  96/97(Oct)	     95/96</p>
<p> Opening stocks	 2.230	 2.230		3.087</p>
<p> Harvested crop	34.352	34.347	     29.825</p>
<p> Delivered crop	30.350	30.340	    *25.949</p>
<p> Non-farm use	  13.078	12.978	    *12.343</p>
<p> Exports to EU	  8.840	 8.300		8.613</p>
<p> Export to non-EU     6.000	 6.800		3.750</p>
<p> Non-EU flour export  1.985	 1.985		1.803</p>
<p> Final stock	    2.297	 2.127		2.230</p>
